1
00:00:00,103 --> 00:00:01,313
(Penny:)Cheers!

2
00:00:04,107 --> 00:00:06,057
(Bernadette:)Emily, what do you do?

3
00:00:06,209 --> 00:00:08,489
(Emily:)I'm a dermatology resident
at Huntington Hospital.

4
00:00:08,645 --> 00:00:10,385
(Raj:)And you know what that means.

5
00:00:10,547 --> 00:00:14,117
(Raj:)Someone's skin's about
to be softer than ever.

6
00:00:15,418 --> 00:00:18,458
(Emily:)This is making me crazy.
I know I know you from somewhere.

7
00:00:18,622 --> 00:00:21,792
(Raj:)Howard was an astronaut.
Maybe that's where you saw him.

8
00:00:21,925 --> 00:00:25,275
(Emily:)Wow, that's amazing.
What was that like?

9
00:00:25,428 --> 00:00:28,238
(Howard:)It was the most incredible
experience of my life.

10
00:00:28,398 --> 00:00:31,108
(Howard:)Up there
in the space station, you're...

11
00:00:31,267 --> 00:00:33,247
(Emily:)Oh, my God, I remember.

12
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,310
(Howard:)Can I finish my astronaut story?

13
00:00:36,473 --> 00:00:37,783
(Emily:)It was four years ago.

14
00:00:37,941 --> 00:00:39,851
(Howard:)-Please don't say it.
-We were set up on a blind date.

15
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,680
(Howard:)-Please don't say it.
-You came to my apartment.

16
00:00:41,845 --> 00:00:43,825
(Howard:)You're saying it.

17
00:00:43,947 --> 00:00:45,487
Well, what happened?

18
00:00:45,649 --> 00:00:47,489
(Bernadette:)-Yeah, what happened?
-OK, I'll say it.

19
00:00:47,617 --> 00:00:52,037
(Howard:)I was on the way to pick her up.

20
00:00:52,188 --> 00:00:54,188
(Howard:)My stomach felt a little funny.

21
00:00:54,357 --> 00:00:57,467
(Howard:)When I got there, I asked
if I could use her bathroom.

22
00:00:57,627 --> 00:01:02,027
(Howard:)Please don't say it.

